            "reading": {
              "en": "(to Him) whose very form is the sacrifice",
              "hi": "(उन को) यज्ञ ही जिनका स्वरूप है"
            },
            "note": "ramakrishna-math-mantrapushpam reads यज्ञस्वरूपाय (mw-yajna: 'Sacrifice personified'). A, B, D, E and F read यक्षस्वरूपाय."
          }
